    ItemTooltip: {
      StarfallResidue: "Remnant ash from an ascendant boss, used to forge endgame equipment."
      AstralIngot: "An endgame metal smelted from Starfall Residue and Moon God Cores."
      ImperialGelShield: "Taking damage briefly forms an imperial gel shield."
      PhaseEyeCore: "Attacks briefly pierce targets and grant phase evasion."
      DevourerMagnet: "Automatically attracts nearby Starfall Residue and ammunition."
      IllusionHeart: "Dodging leaves behind a short-lived illusion."
      HiveHeart: "Increases minion capacity and periodically releases royal honey."
      JudgeMask: "Gain defense and damage as your life gets lower."
      SoulHinge: "Survive lethal damage at 1 life and gain brief invulnerability."
      PrismWing: "Greatly improves flight and leaves a prismatic trail."
      PolarEngine: "Dashing releases a pair of reverse-polarity rays."
      FourArmProtocol: "Gain bonus damage while using several weapon types."
      MagneticCoil: "Ranged hits call a magnetic arc back to you."
      WorldRoot: "Standing still gradually creates a root barrier."
      TitanPrism: "Increases maximum life and makes melee hits shed prisms."
      TideEngine: "Move faster in water and call tide bolts with attacks."
      CoronaCrown: "Releases radiant ring blades and resists blindness."
      FourPillarEdict: "Periodically summons four elemental pillars to assist you."
      CosmicHeart: "Final core: improves all attributes and fires cosmic pulses."
    }
